Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Isanduku-yumutekano gishya: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault hisha: message urufunguzo: key.
>> decrypted := vault hishura: encrypted urufunguzo: key.

Ibisohoka 
andika: ['Message:'], umurongo-mushya
andika: message, umurongo-mushya
andika: ['Decrypted:'], umurongo-mushya
andika: decrypted, umurongo-mushya.
